{"id":80,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿabasa watawallā","translation":"The Prophet frowned and turned away"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"An jāahu l-aʿmā","translation":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting]."},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wamā yud'rīka laʿallahu yazzakkā","translation":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muhammad], that perhaps he might be purified"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Aw yadhakkaru fatanfaʿahu dh-dhik'rā","translation":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Ammā mani is'taghnā","translation":"As for he who thinks himself without need,"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","transliteration":"Fa-anta lahu taṣaddā","translation":"To him you give attention."},{"number":7,"arabicText":"وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Wamā ʿalayka allā yazzakkā","translation":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā man jāaka yasʿā","translation":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ","transliteration":"Wahuwa yakhshā","translation":"While he fears [Allah],"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","transliteration":"Fa-anta ʿanhu talahhā","translation":"From him you are distracted."},{"number":11,"arabicText":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Kallā innahā tadhkirat","translation":"No! Indeed, these verses are a reminder;"},{"number":12,"arabicText":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Faman shāa dhakarah","translation":"So whoever wills may remember it."},{"number":13,"arabicText":"فِى صُحُفٍۢ مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Fī ṣuḥufim-mukarramat","translation":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets,"},{"number":14,"arabicText":"مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","transliteration":"Marfūʿatim-muṭahharat","translation":"Exalted and purified,"},{"number":15,"arabicText":"بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Bi-aydī safarat","translation":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,"},{"number":16,"arabicText":"كِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Kirāmin bararat","translation":"Noble and dutiful."},{"number":17,"arabicText":"قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Qutila l-insānu mā akfarah","translation":"Cursed is man; how disbelieving is he."},{"number":18,"arabicText":"مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min ayyi shayin khalaqah","translation":"From what substance did He create him?"},{"number":19,"arabicText":"مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min-nuṭ'fatin khalaqahu faqaddarah","translation":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;"},{"number":20,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma s-sabīla yassarah","translation":"Then He eased the way for him;"},{"number":21,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma amātahu fa-aqbarah","translation":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him."},{"number":22,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma idhā shāa ansharah","translation":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect him."},{"number":23,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Kallā lammā yaqḍi mā amarah","translation":"No! Man has not yet accomplished what He commanded him."},{"number":24,"arabicText":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"Falyanẓuri l-insānu ilā ṭaʿāmih","translation":"Then let mankind look at his food -"},{"number":25,"arabicText":"أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Annā ṣababnā l-māa ṣabbā","translation":"How We poured down water in torrents,"},{"number":26,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّۭا","transliteration":"Thumma shaqaqnā l-arḍa shaqqā","translation":"Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts],"},{"number":27,"arabicText":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Fa-anbatnā fīhā ḥabbā","translation":"And caused to grow within it grain"},{"number":28,"arabicText":"وَعِنَبًۭا وَقَضْبًۭا","transliteration":"Waʿinabaw-waqaḍbā","translation":"And grapes and herbage"},{"number":29,"arabicText":"وَزَيْتُونًۭا وَنَخْلًۭا","transliteration":"Wazaytūnaw-wanakhlā","translation":"And olive and palm trees"},{"number":30,"arabicText":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًۭا","transliteration":"Waḥadāiqa ghul'bā","translation":"And gardens of dense shrubbery"},{"number":31,"arabicText":"وَفَٰكِهَةًۭ وَأَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Wafākihataw-wa-abbā","translation":"And fruit and grass -"},{"number":32,"arabicText":"مَّتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","transliteration":"Matāʿal-lakum wali-anʿāmikum","translation":"[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock."},{"number":33,"arabicText":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","transliteration":"Fa-idhā jāati ṣ-ṣākhat","translation":"But when there comes the Deafening Blast"},{"number":34,"arabicText":"يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ","transliteration":"Yawma yafirru l-maru min akhīh","translation":"On the Day a man will flee from his brother"},{"number":35,"arabicText":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","transliteration":"Wa-ummihi wa-abīh","translation":"And his mother and his father"},{"number":36,"arabicText":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","transliteration":"Waṣāḥibatihi wabanīh","translation":"And his wife and his children,"},{"number":37,"arabicText":"لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ شَأْنٌۭ يُغْنِيهِ","transliteration":"Likulli im'ri-im-min'hum yawma-idhin shanuy-yugh'nīh","translation":"For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him."},{"number":38,"arabicText":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Wujūhuy-yawma-idhim-mus'firat","translation":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright -"},{"number":39,"arabicText":"ضَاحِكَةٌۭ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Ḍāḥikatum-mus'tabshirat","translation":"Laughing, rejoicing at good news."},{"number":40,"arabicText":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Wawujūhuy-yawma-idhin ʿalayhā ghabarat","translation":"And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust."},{"number":41,"arabicText":"تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","transliteration":"Tarhaquhā qatarat","translation":"Blackness will cover them."},{"number":42,"arabicText":"أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ","transliteration":"Ulāika humu l-kafaratu l-fajarat","translation":"Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones."}]}